  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the Economic Recovery of Iraq Through Employment Creation and Revitalization of Local Economies (Phase III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to the improvement of economic conditions in conflict affected areas in Iraq, and the creation of sustainable employment in particular. It utilizes a multi-faceted approach to livelihoods that includes short term support such as cash for work, longer-term support for both micro-enterprises and small and medium enterprises (MSMEs), and support for the rehabilitation of community-level key economic infrastructure that is critical to support businesses and job creation. This programme also allows IOM to initiate dialogue with the Government of Iraq and other stakeholders on innovative financing mechanisms and access to loans for MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
